   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Irregular stems",
     "texto": [
      "**ser** → **serei** (will be), **ter** → **terei** (will have), **fazer** → **farei** (will do), **dizer** → **direi** (will say), **ir** → **irei** (will go), **poder** → **poderei** (will be able), **saber** → **saberei** (will know).",
      "The endings are the same as in the regular future."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Future to suppose",
     "texto": [
      "The future also expresses supposition: **Será** (it must be / it will be). E.g. **Serão as três?** (can it be three o'clock?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
